## Summary

US-023 implemented successfully. Here's what was built:

**Server** (`apps/server/src/modules/gas-chat/`):
- Streaming chat endpoint at `POST /api/gas-chat` using Vercel AI SDK v6 with `@ai-sdk/gateway`
- `buildGasContext()` fetches real-time data: active contracts, consumer units, monthly consumption (QDR), daily plans (QDP), and significant deviations (>5%)
- System prompt in Portuguese, specialized in gas management terminology (QDC, QDS, QDP, QDR, take-or-pay, tolerances, penalties)
- Suggests navigation to specific pages when relevant

**Frontend** (`apps/web/src/features/gas-chat/`):
- Floating chat button (bottom-right) accessible from all `/gas/*` pages
- Chat panel with streaming message display and typing indicator
- Quick-start suggestion buttons for common questions
- Route link detection - clickable navigation links in responses (e.g., `/gas/penalties`)
- Session-based message history

**Integration**:
- Added to `gas/layout.tsx` so it's available on all gas pages

